    "short_description": "Step into the world of Defend from Candyland! where retro tower defense meets strategic depth. Plant and upgrade trees, use powerful buffs, and reveal enemy paths to shield Eden from waves of candy invaders. Master the challenge now!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil",
    "reviews": "\u201cDefend from Candyland ticks all the correct tower defence boxes. The interface is clear and simple enough to quickly find what you need. The gameplay is logical and 120 levels should keep any strategy fan happy. There are also different difficulty options and an endless mode that both add some longevity.\u201d<br>3.8/5 \u2013 Fusion R Gamer<br><br>\u201cDefend From Candyland is one of the better Tower Defense games in terms of gameplay, but graphically it comes across as a bit weak, despite seeming to honor old Flash games. Still, this is recommended, especially since there are so few games in the genre where you have to think smart about the path you create with your towers.\u201d<br>7.8/10 \u2013 That's Gaming<br>",
